            text1 "   - When you create debug, test, or example scripts while fixing an issue, keep them in {{examplesFolder}} and/or {{experimentsFolder}} so you can reuse them later."
            text2 "   - When you test assumptions, keep experiment scripts in {{experimentsFolder}}."
            text3 "   - When an experiment demonstrates a real-world use case of the software, add it to {{examplesFolder}}."
            text4 "   - When you create debug or test scripts while fixing an issue, keep them in {{experimentsFolder}} so you can reuse them later."
            text5 "   - When you test assumptions, keep experiment scripts in {{experimentsFolder}}."
